{
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Claw.Hit": "The claws rip into you before you have any chance to react."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Claw.Intro": "Akbal's claw-like nails shine green as he leaps forward for a swipe."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.Dodge1": "You narrowly avoid Akbal's fire!"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.Dodge2": "You dodge Akbal's fire with superior quickness!"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.Dodge3": "You deftly avoid Akbal's fire-breath."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.DodgeGeneric": "You manage to dodge Akbal's fire breath."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.Ground": "The ground he scorched remains consumed in flames! You have less room to maneuver now."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.Hit": "Your flesh blisters and cracks as you're consumed by the flames."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FireBreath.Roar": "Letting out a deep and ferocious roar, Akbal releases torrents of emerald fire from his throat."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FlyUp.One": "Akbal frowns as his wounds continue to build, and he suddenly leaps into the air, held aloft with his powerful wings."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.FlyUp.Two": "[pg]He keeps a cautious distance as he glares down at you, his eyes burning with rage."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.PsiAssault.One": "Akbal holds back a moment and time seems to slow down as his eyes shut. They open once more and all you see are his emerald irises shimmering in a black void. Shrill screams echo through your head and Akbal's soothing voice somehow comes out clear."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.PsiAssault.Three": "Your chest feels heavy and breathing gets harder."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.PsiAssault.Two": "[say: Bow to your God.]"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Punch.Hit": "His knuckles slam into you at a stunning force, knocking you back."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Punch.Intro": "The Greater Demon's hand clenches into a fist, whipping green flames out as he charges forward to strike you!"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.SuperHeal.One": "The Greater Demon takes a few steps back, feeling the damage adding up. He glares in fury at you."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.SuperHeal.Three": "Akbal's flesh shimmers as if you're looking at a mirage; soon his wounds fade away without a trace, and a burst of green flames cleanses and purifies his body, returning him to peak condition."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.SuperHeal.Two": "[say: I am the God of the Terrestrial Fire. I was among the first to ascend. You will <b>not</b> stand in my way!]"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Swoop.Dodge": "and manage to narrowly avoid his strike as he passes."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Swoop.Hit": "only to find his fist square in your chest before you can react. You hurdle to the ground in pain."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Swoop.One": "Akbal propels himself toward you with a powerful beat of his wings. You ready yourself to dodge,"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Swoop.Silly": "Akbal holds himself up in the sky as he looks down on you. [say: You were not prepared!]"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.Swoop.Whispered": "but the throbbing of your head locks you in place! The demon's hefty form slams into you, sending you back to the ground."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.TerraFire.Again": "Akbal plants his feet on the ground, sending jolts of emerald light through the earth."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.TerraFire.AgainDodge": "You dash as fast as you possibly can to escape the seismic chaos that follows."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.TerraFire.AgainHit": "An instant later, the ground beneath your feet shatters and topples you into the rising flames!"
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.TerraFire.First": "[say: Tell me, [name], do you know the meaning of 'terrestrial'?] Akbal steps forward, hands palm-forward with his fingers pointing at the ground. [say: It means... of the <b>EARTH!</b>] he shouts with a booming voice as streams of emerald light dart across the ground to you. There's no time to react before the ground shatters beneath you, knocking you down as green flames erupt all over."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.TerraFire.FirstFly": "You leap as fast as you can, taking to the skies to escape the inferno. You land some distance off, wary that you may be safer staying off the ground for this fight."
  "Combat.AkbalUnsealed.TerraFire.FirstHit": "The inferno scalds your flesh, dealing frightening damage before you can stumble away."
}
